#. comic316 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, sheenastand2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic316.htm:146
msgctxt "comic316#p2.2"
msgid "No, the pespective's just kinda messed up in these games."
msgstr ""

#. comic316 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddbutt.gif, sheenaback2.gif, bogeysigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic316.htm:194
msgctxt "comic316#p3.1"
msgid "Check it out! I'm flying! Going up!"
msgstr ""

#. comic316 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddbutt.gif, sheenaback2.gif, bogeysigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic316.htm:198
msgctxt "comic316#p3.2"
msgid "No, you're just moving north, Radd."
msgstr ""

#. comic316 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddbutt.gif, sheenamad2.gif, bogeystand.gif
#: kidradd/comic316.htm:247
msgctxt "comic316#p4.1"
msgid "You sure I'm not lying down? Cuz I'd swear I'm tasting dirt."
msgstr ""

#. comic316 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddbutt.gif, sheenamad2.gif, bogeystand.gif
#: kidradd/comic316.htm:249
msgctxt "comic316#p4.2"
msgid "Keep it up, and you will be."
msgstr ""

#. comic316 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddbutt.gif, sheenamad2.gif, bogeystand.gif
#: kidradd/comic316.htm:251
msgctxt "comic316#p4.3"
msgid "These are some flat-looking houses."
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:42
msgctxt "comic317#title.1"
msgid "\"TALK TOO MUCH\""
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, sheenabl2.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:83
msgctxt "comic317#p1.1"
msgid "So, what do we do?"
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, sheenabl2.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:85
msgctxt "comic317#p1.2"
msgid "\"Talk to everyone!\""
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, sheenabl2.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:87
msgctxt "comic317#p1.3"
msgid "Yeah, good idea."
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddtablem.gif, sheenatablem2.gif
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:141
msgctxt "comic317#p2.1"
msgid "Sigh, just cuz all you NPCs can do is talk, doesn't mean you <i>have</i> to."
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddtablem.gif, sheenatablem2.gif
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:145
msgctxt "comic317#p2.2"
msgid "You have a better idea? Now shut up and get talking."
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: npcb1.gif, raddsigh2.gif, bogeysneer2.gif
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:191
msgctxt "comic317#p3.1"
msgid "\"The princess is quite preoccupied lately.\" Oh wait - you're not the hero."
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: npcb1.gif, raddsigh2.gif, bogeysneer2.gif
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:195
msgctxt "comic317#p3.2"
msgid "Easy mistake. But can you tell us how to find him?"
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: npcb1.gif, raddstare2.gif, bogeyyell.gif, heroatt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:243
msgctxt "comic317#p4.1"
msgid "Turn around."
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: npcb1.gif, raddstare2.gif, bogeyyell.gif, heroatt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:245
msgctxt "comic317#p4.2"
msgid "Hm? Oh, hi."
msgstr ""

#. comic317 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: npcb1.gif, raddstare2.gif, bogeyyell.gif, heroatt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic317.htm:247
msgctxt "comic317#p4.3"
msgid "ATTACK!"
msgstr ""

#. comic318 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic318.htm:42
msgctxt "comic318#title.1"
msgid "\"TLC\""
msgstr ""

#. comic318 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, bogeystand.gif, raddstand.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic318.htm:83
msgctxt "comic318#p1.1"
msgid "Are you this game's hero?"
msgstr ""

#. comic318 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, bogeystand.gif, raddstand.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic318.htm:87
msgctxt "comic318#p1.2"
msgid "Stay back, fair damsel! I'll save you from that monster!"
msgstr ""

#. comic318 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, bogeyyell.gif, raddstare.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic318.htm:140
msgctxt "comic318#p2.1"
msgid "You mean <i>Bogey?</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic318 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, bogeyyell.gif, raddstare.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic318.htm:142
msgctxt "comic318#p2.2"
msgid "I'm not a monster! Well, not exactly..."
msgstr ""

#. comic318 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, bogeyyell.gif, raddstare.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic318.htm:144
msgctxt "comic318#p2.3"
msgid "Silence, beast!"
msgstr ""

#. comic318 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: hhead.gif
#: kidradd/comic318.htm:194
msgctxt "comic318#p3.1"
msgid "I thought I'd seen every monster in this game, but you're new to me, meaning you're extremely rare. ...And probably worth thousands of EXP!"
msgstr ""

#. comic318 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, raddblink2.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic318.htm:245
msgctxt "comic318#p4.1"
msgid "What the heck is an EXP?"
msgstr ""

#. comic318 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, raddblink2.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic318.htm:247
msgctxt "comic318#p4.2"
msgid "I think it's one of those human words, like OMG or BRB."
msgstr ""

#. comic318 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, raddblink2.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic318.htm:249
msgctxt "comic318#p4.3"
msgid "Hmm, I haven't seen <i>you</i> guys either..."
msgstr ""

#. comic319 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic319.htm:48
msgctxt "comic319#title.1"
msgid "\"READY TO RUMBLE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic319 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddstand.gif, bogeymad.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic319.htm:89
msgctxt "comic319#p1.1"
msgid "Listen buddy, you're making a big mistake."
msgstr ""

#. comic319 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddstand.gif, bogeymad.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic319.htm:93
msgctxt "comic319#p1.2"
msgid "Impossible."
msgstr ""

#. comic319 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: hhead.gif
#: kidradd/comic319.htm:149
msgctxt "comic319#p2.1"
msgid "Ordinarily, monsters never appear within city limits. So you're either A, an ultra-rare secret that'll probably give me tons of EXP and an item after battle..."
msgstr ""

#. comic319 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddstand.gif, bogeymad.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic319.htm:200
msgctxt "comic319#p3.1"
msgid "Or B, a plot-related character, that'll trigger a scripted battle, and FINALLY advance the damn story. And I'll finally get on with the game."
msgstr ""

#. comic319 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, raddstand.gif, bogeysigh.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic319.htm:254
msgctxt "comic319#p4.1"
msgid "But the story's not advancing because the game isn't being played. No human is controlling any of us."
msgstr ""

#. comic319 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, raddstand.gif, bogeysigh.gif, hero2.gif
#: kidradd/comic319.htm:258
msgctxt "comic319#p4.2"
msgid "You lie! And I'll prove it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic319 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic319.htm:309
msgctxt "comic319#p5.1"
msgid "ATTACK!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic319 panel p5
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic319.htm:320
msgctxt "comic319#p5.2"
msgid "To be continued!"
msgstr ""

#. comic320 panel title
