#. comic321 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, raddflip.gif, bogeylsigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic321.htm:297
msgctxt "comic321#p4.1"
msgid "Marcel Marceau, top <b>this!</b>"
