#. comic322 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenasmug.gif, raddmstare.gif, bogeylsigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic322.htm:169
msgctxt "comic322#p2.1"
msgid "What? We gotta take <i>turns</i> attacking?"
