#. comic322 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenasmug.gif, raddmstare.gif, bogeylsigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic322.htm:196
msgctxt "comic322#p2.2"
msgid "Yep, that's how it works."
msgstr ""

#. comic322 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaback.gif, charge.gif, bogeylook.gif
#: kidradd/comic322.htm:238
msgctxt "comic322#p3.1"
msgid "Screw that, I'm going now!"
