#. comic324 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenaback.gif, raddstare.gif, bogeyltalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic324.htm:247
msgctxt "comic324#p3.2"
msgid "That's how much HP you removed."
msgstr ""

#. comic324 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: rheadjoy.gif, sheadsad.gif
#: kidradd/comic324.htm:293
msgctxt "comic324#p4.1"
msgid "Oh, HP, that's like a lifemeter, right? So how much more HP's this guy got?"
